Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(n2) -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n4,"Check credit history") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"Is applicant eligible?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"Prepare acceptance pack") -> action(n7,"Send acceptance pack") -> action(n9,"End: Acceptance pack sent") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(n2) -> branch(b2,AND) -> action(n4,"Check credit history") -> converge(c1) -> action(n5,"Is applicant eligible?") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n8,"Reject application") -> action(n10,"End: Application rejected") -> end(e2)